-- `hπsurj`, `hFtr`, `hFgal` and `hirrF` are not consumed by the proof (see
-- the PROOF paragraph above) but are KEPT: the hypothesis list is the shared
-- interface of the three sub-leaves (a)/(b)/(c) of this cut, the consumer
