    -- an intermediate field of `AlgebraicClosure ℚ_[p] / ℚ_[p]`, transported
    -- across `ULift`.  Its consumer needs this — see the ROUND-10 note on
    -- `nonempty_carayolJacobianPackage_of_heckeAlgebraCharacter`.
