/-- **The Frobenius characteristic polynomial of a hardly ramified `ρ`
depends only on the RESIDUE CARDINALITY of the place** (PROVEN
2026-07-26, cut the same day; PURE ALGEBRAIC NUMBER THEORY — no automorphic input
